    "title": "Hopkinsville volleyball hands out final awards - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joe Wilson ,\n19 hours ago Hopkinsville High School’s volleyball team held its final awards banquet on Tuesday night at the Memorial Building. Madysen Taggart, Alayna King, and Kyleigh Weber each took home a pair of awards. Taggart earned Most Aces and Most Kills. King took home the Hustler Award and Most Assists. Weber earned... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
